1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,108
一位顾客要为一场品鉴会买奶酪
A customer wants cheese for a tasting:

2
00:00:03,108 --> 00:00:07,198
宾夕法尼亚 12 位客人，150 美元预算，不要坚果
12 guests in Pennsylvania, a $150 budget, no nuts,

3
00:00:07,198 --> 00:00:11,861
一款法国奶酪，还有一款浓烈度 4 或以上
a French cheese, and one with a funk rating of 4 or more.

4
00:00:12,181 --> 00:00:14,976
这是两个回答，来自同一个模型和同一套工具
Here are two answers from the same model and tools.

5
00:00:15,217 --> 00:00:20,380
第一个提议 1050 克，5600 美分
The first proposes 1,050 grams for 5,600 cents.

6
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:24,129
第二个是 1200 克，6400 美分
The second, 1,200 grams for 6,400 cents,

7
00:00:24,129 --> 00:00:30,129
说是在一个逗号放错了地方的预算之内：一个格式错误的数字
within a budget with the comma in the wrong place: a malformed number.

8
00:00:30,367 --> 00:00:33,183
这两个里面，你会让哪一个去刷顾客的卡？
Which of these would you let charge a customer's card?

9
00:00:33,503 --> 00:00:35,392
而且在那之前，必须先满足什么条件？
And what would have to be true first?

10
00:00:36,583 --> 00:00:38,354
第二次运行打印了更多内容
The second run printed more.

11
00:00:38,674 --> 00:00:41,549
代码检查了购物车本身
Code checked the cart itself:

12
00:00:41,549 --> 00:00:47,100
1200 克，64 美元，满足店铺规则，没有下单
1,200 grams, $64, shop rules satisfied, no order placed.

13
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:50,706
购物车是有效的；只是那句话写乱了
The cart was valid; only the sentence was garbled.

14
00:00:51,026 --> 00:00:53,714
第一个回答最终的购物车，根本没经过检查
Nothing checked the first answer's final cart.

15
00:00:53,950 --> 00:00:58,921
课程的 notebook 用一句话说清了：模型提议；harness 决定
The course notebook says it in one line: the model proposes; the harness decides.

16
00:00:59,241 --> 00:01:01,807
所谓 harness，就是模型外面的代码
The harness is the code around the model:

17
00:01:01,807 --> 00:01:04,873
循环、它的限制、它的上下文和它的检查
the loop, its limits, its context and its checks.

18
00:01:05,193 --> 00:01:08,670
今天我们把输出的每一行，都归到这两栏里
Today we sort every line of output into these two columns.

19
00:01:08,917 --> 00:01:12,736
第 7 讲和 README 分成同样的七节，顺序也一样
Lecture 7 and the README share seven sections, in order.

20
00:01:13,056 --> 00:01:16,314
教程在一家虚构的奶酪店里分六幕进行
The tutorial runs six acts in a fictional cheese shop,

21
00:01:16,314 --> 00:01:19,391
那里什么都不会真的买、真的寄，也不会真的发邮件
where nothing is really bought, shipped or emailed.

22
00:01:19,633 --> 00:01:22,473
左上角的进度条显示 README 的步骤
The tracker, top left, shows the README step;

23
00:01:22,473 --> 00:01:25,628
右上角的灰色标签显示对应的课件
the gray tag, top right, shows the lecture slides.

24
00:01:25,948 --> 00:01:28,956
看到标签写着 your turn，就暂停，自己跑这条命令
When a tag says your turn, pause and run the command.

25
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:36,366
坦白说一个限制：2026 年 10 月 20 日录制时
One honest limit: we recorded this on October 20, 2026,

26
00:01:36,366 --> 00:01:38,432
我们没有 OpenAI 密钥
without an OpenAI key.

27
00:01:38,752 --> 00:01:41,167
离线的部分都是真实运行的
Everything offline ran for real;

28
00:01:41,167 --> 00:01:45,621
在线命令一直跑到 OpenAI 拒绝占位密钥为止
live commands ran until OpenAI refused the placeholder key.

29
00:01:45,941 --> 00:01:50,165
在线运行的回答，来自课程团队保存的 Colab 运行和 README
Live answers come from the staff's saved Colab run and the README.

30
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:53,024
唯一的花费是 OpenAI 的 token
The only cost is OpenAI tokens.

31
00:01:53,344 --> 00:01:58,229
顾客 ID 在画面上遮住了，每条命令都在学习指南里
Customer IDs are masked on screen, and every command is in the study guide.

32
00:02:00,767 --> 00:02:02,611
你的笔记本上有 clone 下来的 repo
Your laptop holds the clone,

33
00:02:02,611 --> 00:02:04,991
旁边是一个空的 secrets 目录
with an empty secrets folder beside it.

34
00:02:05,311 --> 00:02:10,644
一个 container 挂载这两个目录，密钥以环境变量的形式传进去
One container mounts both, your key goes in as an environment variable,

35
00:02:10,644 --> 00:02:15,828
不发布任何 port，应用唯一的对外调用是走 HTTPS 去 OpenAI
no port is published, and the app's only call out is HTTPS to OpenAI.

36
00:02:16,067 --> 00:02:20,125
先做两个额外步骤：git clone，因为 README 默认你已经有一份
Two extras first: git clone, since the README assumes a copy,

37
00:02:20,125 --> 00:02:25,048
然后进入 agent-harness 目录，所有准备命令都在这里运行
then change into the agent-harness folder, where every setup command runs.

38
00:02:25,368 --> 00:02:28,760
列出的文件里没有 docs 目录；这一点后面很重要
A listing shows no docs folder; that matters later.

39
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,093
第 1 步在上一级创建 secrets 目录
Step 1 makes the secrets folder, one level up.

40
00:02:32,413 --> 00:02:35,293
今天没有东西会读它，所以不需要服务账号
Nothing reads it today, so no service account.

41
00:02:35,613 --> 00:02:37,213
暂停一下，跑一遍
Pause and run it.

42
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,728
第 2 步导出你的密钥
Step 2 exports your key.

43
00:02:41,048 --> 00:02:44,952
把占位符换成你自己的密钥，或者离线时跳过这一行
Replace the placeholder with your own, or skip this line offline.

44
00:02:45,272 --> 00:02:48,515
我们是照原样输入的；第 1 幕会看到这样做的结果
We typed it as written; act 1 shows what that does.

45
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:51,436
第 3 步：bash docker-shell.sh
Step 3, bash docker-shell.sh, builds the image and starts the container.

46
00:02:51,436 --> 00:02:53,913
构建 image 并启动 container
Step 3, bash docker-shell.sh, builds the image and starts the container.

47
00:02:54,233 --> 00:02:58,695
我们的构建用了 38 秒，当时 base image 已经在机器上
Ours took 38 seconds, with the base image already on the machine;

48
00:02:58,695 --> 00:03:02,745
你第一次构建还要先 pull 它，所以预计要一分钟或更久
your first build also pulls it, so expect a minute or more.

49
00:03:02,984 --> 00:03:07,218
Dockerfile 先根据 lock 文件安装，再复制代码
The Dockerfile installs from the lockfile before it copies the code:

50
00:03:07,218 --> 00:03:09,149
这是第 2 讲讲过的分层技巧
the layer trick from lecture 2.

51
00:03:09,384 --> 00:03:14,931
横幅说环境已经激活了，可这时脚本还没激活它：一个无害的小疏漏
The banner says the environment is activated before the script activates it: a harmless slip.

52
00:03:15,251 --> 00:03:18,002
紧跟在 @ 符号后面的，是 container ID
After the at sign comes the container ID.

53
00:03:18,250 --> 00:03:21,685
从这里开始，每条命令都在 container 里运行
From here on, every command runs inside the container.

54
00:03:22,005 --> 00:03:25,376
暂停一下，跑第 2、3 步，等到出现这个提示符
Pause, run steps 2 and 3, and wait for this prompt.

55
00:03:27,617 --> 00:03:29,708
在第二个终端里做三个额外检查
Three extras from a second terminal.

56
00:03:30,028 --> 00:03:31,969
先看 docker ps：没有 port
docker ps: no ports.

57
00:03:32,289 --> 00:03:38,796
再看 docker images：1.77 GB，因为框架把所有集成都装上了
docker images: 1.77 gigabytes, since the framework installs every integration.

58
00:03:39,034 --> 00:03:43,137
用 docker inspect，能在 container 的配置里看到你的密钥
docker inspect shows your key in the container's configuration;

59
00:03:43,137 --> 00:03:45,092
真实的密钥要当作敏感信息对待
treat a real key as sensitive.

60
00:03:45,334 --> 00:03:49,570
第 4 步适用于改密钥时 container 已经在运行的情况
Step 4 is for a container already running when you changed the key:

61
00:03:49,570 --> 00:03:54,059
这时脚本只会运行 docker exec，而它不会带上新的密钥
the script then only runs docker exec, which doesn't bring the new key.

62
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:57,511
如果是这种情况，就从第二个终端进到 container 的 shell 里
If that's you, shell in from a second terminal

63
00:03:57,511 --> 00:03:59,207
再输入 README 的那三行
and type the README's three lines:

64
00:03:59,207 --> 00:04:02,151
密钥隐藏着输入，也不会留在你的历史记录里
the key goes in hidden, and out of your history.

65
00:04:02,471 --> 00:04:05,202
之后一直在那个 shell 里操作。在这里暂停
Keep working in that shell. Pause here.

66
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:12,444
现在在 container 里离线验证
Now verify, offline, inside the container.

67
00:04:12,764 --> 00:04:18,115
第 1 步检查 SDK，并打印安装的版本
Step 1 checks the SDK and prints the installed versions,

68
00:04:18,115 --> 00:04:24,326
录制时是 Python 3.13.16、agent-framework 1.19.0
at the time of recording: Python 3.13.16, agent-framework 1.19.0,

69
00:04:24,326 --> 00:04:26,524
而且每个功能都是 true
and every feature true.

70
00:04:26,767 --> 00:04:33,551
第 2 步跑测试：一共 281 个，大约 100 秒，最后是 OK
Step 2 runs the tests: 281 of them, in about 100 seconds, ending in OK.

71
00:04:33,871 --> 00:04:38,500
它们用的是脚本模拟的模型回复，所以测的是这套机制，不是模型
They use scripted model responses, so they test the machinery, not the model.

72
00:04:39,750 --> 00:04:44,772
第 3 步显示日志：故意制造的失败，比如注入的审计故障
Step 3 shows the logs: deliberate failures, like an injected audit outage,

73
00:04:44,772 --> 00:04:48,369
还有一个第 4 幕会再遇到的审批身份警告
and an approval-identity warning we'll meet in act 4.

74
00:04:48,689 --> 00:04:50,267
以最后一行为准
Trust the last line.

75
00:04:50,317 --> 00:04:57,400
模型检查只打印默认模型，并不调用它：录制时是 gpt-5.6-luna
The model check prints the default without calling it: gpt-5.6-luna, at the time of recording.

76
00:04:57,720 --> 00:05:00,531
命令行里的 --model 参数优先于环境变量
A --model flag beats an environment variable,

77
00:05:00,531 --> 00:05:02,092
环境变量又优先于这个默认值
which beats this default;

78
00:05:02,092 --> 00:05:04,653
如果你的账号用不了它，就设置其中一个
if your account can't use it, set either.

79
00:05:04,900 --> 00:05:08,207
README 的 notebook 那一节还有两条测试命令
The README's notebook section has two more test commands.

80
00:05:08,527 --> 00:05:10,755
它们也在 container 里运行
They run in the container too:

81
00:05:10,755 --> 00:05:14,393
9 个 notebook 测试，12 个 chat view 测试，都是 OK
9 notebook tests and 12 chat view tests, both OK.

82
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:17,711
还有第二条路：课程的 Colab
There's a second road: the course Colab.

83
00:05:18,031 --> 00:05:20,003
把副本保存到你的 Drive
Save a copy to your Drive,

84
00:05:20,003 --> 00:05:23,491
把密钥存成一个名叫 OpenAI API key 的 secret
add your key as a secret named OPENAI_API_KEY,

85
00:05:23,491 --> 00:05:27,055
打开 Notebook access，再运行准备单元格
allow notebook access, and run the setup cells.

86
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:30,836
Colab 准备时装的是那七个 pin 了版本的包
The Colab setup installs the seven pinned packages,

87
00:05:30,836 --> 00:05:34,302
而不是 lock 文件，所以它们的依赖可能会漂移
not the lockfile, so their dependencies can drift;

88
00:05:34,302 --> 00:05:36,729
要版本完全一致，就用 Docker
for identical versions, use Docker.

89
00:05:36,967 --> 00:05:39,051
这期视频里每个录下来的回答
Every recorded answer in this video

90
00:05:39,051 --> 00:05:41,255
都来自这个 notebook 保存的那次运行
comes from this notebook's saved run.

91
00:05:41,575 --> 00:05:44,135
暂停一下，两条路任选一条，把你的环境验证一遍
Pause, and verify your setup either way.

92
00:05:47,283 --> 00:05:49,853
第 1 幕从课上的回顾开始
Act 1 starts from the lecture's recap:

93
00:05:49,853 --> 00:05:55,262
agent 就是一个带着指令和工具的模型，一直运行到任务完成
an agent is a model with instructions and tools, running until the task is done.

94
00:05:55,500 --> 00:05:59,586
在代码里，build agent 这个函数会创建一个框架里的 agent
In code, the function build_agent makes one framework agent:

95
00:05:59,586 --> 00:06:04,012
店里的指令、五个工具，以及结构化的回复格式
the shop instructions, five tools, and a structured reply format.

96
00:06:04,250 --> 00:06:07,621
模型只能请求工具；工具由 harness 来运行
The model can only ask for a tool; the harness runs it.

97
00:06:07,941 --> 00:06:10,608
而且这五个工具都不能下单
And none of these five can place an order:

98
00:06:10,608 --> 00:06:14,101
preview order 工具只记录一个未经验证的提议
the preview_order tool records an unvalidated proposal,

99
00:06:14,101 --> 00:06:16,196
order placed 设为 false
with "order_placed" set to False.

100
00:06:16,433 --> 00:06:22,556
第 1 步：python cli.py --act 1 --scenario standard
Step 1: python cli.py --act 1 --scenario standard.

101
00:06:22,876 --> 00:06:25,609
你会看到需求、第 1 次调用和五个工具
You see the ask, call 1 and five tools;

102
00:06:25,609 --> 00:06:29,532
接着调用失败，报 401：占位密钥
then the call fails with error 401: the placeholder key.

103
00:06:29,852 --> 00:06:31,352
在这个 shell 里就能修好
Fix it in this shell

104
00:06:31,352 --> 00:06:33,734
用 Setup 的第 4 步那三行 read 命令
with the three read lines from setup step 4.

105
00:06:34,054 --> 00:06:36,102
失败的运行照样会记录下来
The failed run is still recorded.

106
00:06:36,350 --> 00:06:39,294
下面是有密钥时的样子，来自课程团队保存的运行
Here's what a key gets you, from the staff's saved run.

107
00:06:39,614 --> 00:06:41,598
模型请求商品清单
The model asks for the catalog;

108
00:06:41,598 --> 00:06:45,950
harness 运行这个工具，结果再送回去：又多了两条消息
the harness runs it, and the result goes back in: two more messages.

109
00:06:46,200 --> 00:06:48,227
每一轮都在同一个接缝处分开
Every round splits at the same seam.

110
00:06:48,547 --> 00:06:51,276
模型的计划止于 Requested tools
The model's plan ends at Requested tools;

111
00:06:51,276 --> 00:06:53,539
harness 从 Tool call 开始执行
the harness executes at Tool call.

112
00:06:53,859 --> 00:06:57,357
这个 trace 显示的是请求和结果，不是隐藏的推理
The trace shows requests and results, not hidden reasoning.

113
00:06:57,600 --> 00:07:00,203
然后是库存、价格、搭配和预览
Then stock, price, pairings and preview.

114
00:07:00,523 --> 00:07:05,536
第 6 次调用时，模型直接回答，没有请求工具，循环就停了
On call 6 the model answers without asking for a tool, and the loop stops.

115
00:07:05,856 --> 00:07:12,942
消息从 1 条涨到 11 条，输入从 1942 涨到 4540 个 token
Messages grew from 1 to 11, input from 1,942 to 4,540 tokens:

116
00:07:12,942 --> 00:07:18,634
一共大约 21000 个计费的输入 token，只为了一个回答
about 21,000 billed input tokens, for one answer.

117
00:07:18,883 --> 00:07:22,976
第 2 步加上 --show-json，看确切的消息
Step 2 adds --show-json, to see the exact message:

118
00:07:22,976 --> 00:07:26,988
一段简短的说明，加上 JSON 形式的已确认需求
a short note, plus the confirmed request as JSON,

119
00:07:26,988 --> 00:07:29,443
其中 null 表示没有提供
where null means not provided.

120
00:07:29,763 --> 00:07:31,811
暂停一下，用你的密钥把两条都跑一遍
Pause and run both, with your key.

121
00:07:34,050 --> 00:07:35,991
每调用一次，输入就会变长
The input grows with every call.

122
00:07:36,311 --> 00:07:40,236
这就是课上的问题：怎么管理进入模型的东西？
That's the lecture's question: how do we manage what goes into the model?

123
00:07:42,183 --> 00:07:45,281
课上说得很直白：如果你写过一个循环
The lecture says it plainly: if you've written a loop

124
00:07:45,281 --> 00:07:49,372
它调用模型并执行工具调用，那你就是 harness 工程师
that calls a model and runs its tool calls, you're a harness engineer.

125
00:07:49,692 --> 00:07:51,420
而一个裸循环是停不下来的
And a bare loop has no stop.

126
00:07:51,666 --> 00:07:55,031
第 3 步是一个 notebook 单元格，在 Colab 或 Jupyter 里用
Step 3 is a notebook cell, for Colab or Jupyter,

127
00:07:55,031 --> 00:07:57,554
它把 build agent 包进一个 harness
that wraps build_agent in a harness.

128
00:07:57,874 --> 00:07:58,994
它加上 Trace
It adds Trace,

129
00:07:58,994 --> 00:08:03,551
Budget 限模型调用 8 次、工具调用 20 次、时长 120 秒
Budget with 8 model calls, 20 tool calls and 120 seconds,

130
00:08:03,551 --> 00:08:06,109
basic Context 和 CartCheck
Context("basic"), and CartCheck.

131
00:08:06,429 --> 00:08:08,477
CLI 构建的正是这个
The CLI builds exactly this.

132
00:08:09,916 --> 00:08:14,737
内环永远拆不掉：调用准入、工具审计和店铺规则
The inner ring never comes off: call admission, the tool audit and the shop rules.

133
00:08:15,057 --> 00:08:18,578
四个 harness 层套在它外面，每层一个功能
Four harness layers slide on around it, one feature each.

134
00:08:20,316 --> 00:08:21,916
Budget 是一个闸机
Budget is a turnstile.

135
00:08:22,151 --> 00:08:24,635
每次模型调用都要放行并计数
Each model call is admitted and counted;

136
00:08:24,635 --> 00:08:26,135
第九次会失败，报的是
a ninth fails

137
00:08:26,135 --> 00:08:30,066
Maximum of 8 model calls reached，而且锁会一直关着
with Maximum of 8 model calls reached, and the lock stays shut.

138
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:34,174
没有 Budget，就只剩框架的兜底
Without Budget, only the framework's fallback is left:

139
00:08:34,174 --> 00:08:38,406
40 次循环迭代，没有调用次数上限，也没有总的时间预算
40 loop iterations, no call limits, no overall time budget.

140
00:08:39,350 --> 00:08:41,889
CartCheck 就是课上的验证步骤
CartCheck is the lecture's verify step.

141
00:08:42,209 --> 00:08:44,555
回到开头的例子：它检查的是商品明细
Back to the hook: it checked the items,

142
00:08:44,555 --> 00:08:47,563
不是文字，所以预算写乱了也照样通过
not the prose, so the garbled budget still passed.

143
00:08:47,883 --> 00:08:49,952
它只报告，从不修复
It reports, and never repairs.

144
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:53,858
现在这两栏变成了课上的行动边界
Now the two columns become the lecture's action boundary:

145
00:08:53,858 --> 00:08:58,477
五个关注点，左边是模型负责的部分，右边是 harness 的
five concerns, the model's part on the left, the harness's on the right.

146
00:08:58,716 --> 00:09:00,465
第 1 幕填了三行
Act 1 fills three rows.

147
00:09:00,785 --> 00:09:04,412
风险高或操作无法撤销时就往右移
Move right when stakes are high, or an action can't be undone.

148
00:09:04,650 --> 00:09:06,250
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

149
00:09:06,314 --> 00:09:09,258
用 harness without trace 得到一个副本，再运行它
Take harness.without("trace"), and run that copy.

150
00:09:09,578 --> 00:09:11,903
工具调用还会计数、还会审计吗？
Is a tool call still counted and audited?

151
00:09:12,223 --> 00:09:14,548
而原来那个 harness 还会记录 trace 吗？
And does the original harness still trace?

152
00:09:23,383 --> 00:09:24,848
是，也是
Yes, and yes.

153
00:09:24,898 --> 00:09:27,287
准入和审计就是内环
Admission and the audit are the inner ring.

154
00:09:27,607 --> 00:09:31,462
而且 add 和 without 方法从不修改 harness
And the .add() and .without() methods never change a harness:

155
00:09:31,462 --> 00:09:36,012
每次都返回一个新的配置，所以原来那个 harness 的四层都还在
each returns a new configuration, so the original keeps all four layers.

156
00:09:36,250 --> 00:09:39,045
第 4 步运行 missing-details 场景
Step 4 runs the missing-details scenario.

157
00:09:39,365 --> 00:09:43,266
有密钥的话，要找的是反问，而不是编造的细节
With a key, look for a question back, not invented details;

158
00:09:43,266 --> 00:09:45,381
CartCheck 应该报告 no cart
CartCheck should report no_cart.

159
00:09:45,701 --> 00:09:47,301
暂停一下，跑一遍
Pause and run it.

160
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:54,203
第 2 幕改的是模型看到的东西：课上说的看不见的那一层
Act 2 changes what the model sees: the lecture's invisible layer.

161
00:09:54,523 --> 00:09:57,678
这是按课上的上下文栈画出的一次模型调用
Here is one model call as the lecture's stack:

162
00:09:57,678 --> 00:10:02,821
system prompt 和店铺政策、需求、回复格式、五个工具
system prompt and shop policies, the request, the reply format, five tools,

163
00:10:02,821 --> 00:10:06,661
还有两个空位，留给检索到的数据和保存的偏好
and two slots, for retrieved data and saved preferences.

164
00:10:06,900 --> 00:10:12,184
第 1 幕用的 basic 模式只发前四块，空位留空
Basic mode, the one act 1 used, sends the first four and leaves the slots empty;

165
00:10:12,184 --> 00:10:13,784
而 enriched 把它们填满
enriched fills them.

166
00:10:15,433 --> 00:10:19,244
第 1 步 --compare 用的是 personalized 场景
Step 1, --compare, uses the personalized scenario,

167
00:10:19,244 --> 00:10:27,401
今天的需求没提第二位顾客保存的口味：温和的奶酪和无酒精搭配
where today's request leaves out the second customer's saved taste: mild cheeses and nonalcoholic pairings.

168
00:10:27,721 --> 00:10:32,372
先跑的 basic 一启动就停在 401，所以 enriched 根本没有开始
The basic run starts and stops at the 401, so enriched never starts.

169
00:10:32,617 --> 00:10:36,357
有密钥的话，它会打印一张并排对比表和一个结论
With a key, it prints a side-by-side table and a verdict,

170
00:10:36,357 --> 00:10:38,654
结论也可能是打平或者退步
which may be a tie or a regression.

171
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:41,631
第 2 到第 4 步是可选的单次运行
Steps 2 to 4 are optional single runs.

172
00:10:41,951 --> 00:10:45,171
即使没有密钥，也能看到一个真实的差别
Even without a key, there's a real difference:

173
00:10:45,171 --> 00:10:48,881
basic 发 1 条对话消息，enriched 发 2 条
basic sends 1 conversation message, enriched sends 2;

174
00:10:48,881 --> 00:10:51,401
多出来的那条就是上下文包
the extra one is the context packet.

175
00:10:51,867 --> 00:10:55,376
第 4 步是偏好覆盖那次运行，要求浓烈度 4 或以上
Step 4, the override run, asks for funk 4 or more,

176
00:10:55,376 --> 00:10:59,804
今天的需求必须压过保存的口味。README 里说
and today's request must win over the saved taste. The README

177
00:10:59,804 --> 00:11:03,762
第 2 幕的每条命令还会额外打印一个 harness 政策检查
says each act 2 command also prints a harness policy check.

178
00:11:04,082 --> 00:11:06,792
一个小疏漏：--compare 不会
A small slip: --compare doesn't.

179
00:11:07,112 --> 00:11:10,432
这条额外的命令会打印：同一辆生乳奶酪的购物车
This extra call does: the same raw-milk cart fails

180
00:11:10,432 --> 00:11:14,749
寄往宾夕法尼亚不通过，寄往纽约通过，依据的是一条虚构的规则
for Pennsylvania and passes for New York, under a fictional rule.

181
00:11:18,233 --> 00:11:21,733
第 5 步是一条第 3 幕的命令，README 把它放在了这里
Step 5 is an act 3 command the README puts here;

182
00:11:21,733 --> 00:11:23,333
第二部分会讲它
part 2 explains it.

183
00:11:23,967 --> 00:11:27,864
第 6 步把两个用例在两种模式下各重复 3 次
Step 6 repeats both cases in both modes, 3 times:

184
00:11:27,864 --> 00:11:29,464
一共 12 次在线运行
12 live runs.

185
00:11:29,684 --> 00:11:32,195
没有密钥时，它在 3 个错误之后就停了
Without a key it stops after 3 errors,

186
00:11:32,195 --> 00:11:34,705
但报告照样会在第 7 步写出来
but the report still writes in step 7,

187
00:11:34,705 --> 00:11:38,537
label 也用掉了：有密钥的话，换一个新的
and the label is used up: with your key, choose a new one.

188
00:11:38,783 --> 00:11:42,699
这里链接的页面，本该放在我们看到缺失的那个 docs 目录里
The page linked here belongs in the docs folder we saw missing,

189
00:11:42,699 --> 00:11:44,564
所以就用 README 的检查点
so use the README checkpoints.

190
00:11:44,884 --> 00:11:46,485
有密钥的话就在这里暂停
Pause here if you have a key.

191
00:11:49,833 --> 00:11:53,908
README 里，Inspect the context first 排在在线运行之后
The README prints Inspect the context first after the live runs.

192
00:11:54,228 --> 00:11:58,366
没有密钥的话，就从这里开始：离线跑 --preview-context
Without a key, start here: --preview-context, offline.

193
00:11:58,686 --> 00:12:03,316
两种模式的指令、消息和工具都一样；只有上下文包不同
Both modes share instructions, message and tools; only the packets differ.

194
00:12:03,550 --> 00:12:05,278
其中 basic 没有来源
Basic has no sources.

195
00:12:05,598 --> 00:12:08,471
而 enriched 有三个，每个都带一个信任标注
Enriched has three, each with a trust label:

196
00:12:08,471 --> 00:12:12,126
已确认的需求、店铺数据和保存的偏好
the confirmed request, shop data, and saved preferences.

197
00:12:12,366 --> 00:12:15,086
十二种奶酪穿过三层筛子
Twelve cheeses fall through three sieves:

198
00:12:15,086 --> 00:12:19,065
库存够、不往宾夕法尼亚寄生乳、没有坚果过敏原
enough stock, no raw milk to Pennsylvania, no nut allergens.

199
00:12:19,385 --> 00:12:23,138
Munster 没有库存，Brie 和 Comté 过不了运输规则
Munster has no stock, Brie and Comté fail the shipping rule,

200
00:12:23,138 --> 00:12:25,827
两种含坚果的奶酪过不了过敏检查
and two nut cheeses fail the allergy check.

201
00:12:26,147 --> 00:12:27,747
七种留了下来
Seven survive.

202
00:12:31,266 --> 00:12:34,960
课上说的检索信息指任何外部数据
The lecture's retrieved information is any outside data;

203
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:39,181
在这里它是一个 Python 过滤器，不是第 5 讲的向量检索
here it's a Python filter, not the vector search from lecture 5.

204
00:12:39,416 --> 00:12:40,902
那它放在哪儿？
And where does it go?

205
00:12:40,952 --> 00:12:44,192
放进一条以 Retrieved context 为标题的 user 消息
Into a user message headed Retrieved context,

206
00:12:44,192 --> 00:12:48,440
是数据，不是指令，所以它没法冒充系统规则
data, not instructions, so it cannot pose as a system rule.

207
00:12:48,760 --> 00:12:54,456
这就是课上的两条通道：指令走 system 通道，证据走 user 通道
That's the lecture's two lanes: instructions in the system lane, evidence in the user lane.

208
00:12:54,700 --> 00:12:56,300
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

209
00:12:56,364 --> 00:12:59,116
这个 enriched 上下文包已经去掉了 Comté
The enriched packet already removed Comté.

210
00:12:59,436 --> 00:13:01,847
模型还能把 Comté 放进它的购物车吗？
Can the model still put Comté in its cart?

211
00:13:02,167 --> 00:13:04,321
第 2 幕里有什么能拦住它吗？
And does anything in act 2 stop it?

212
00:13:13,166 --> 00:13:16,768
能：get catalog 工具仍然返回全部十二种奶酪
Yes: the get_catalog tool still returns all twelve,

213
00:13:16,768 --> 00:13:19,310
而在第 2 幕，CartCheck 只报告
and in act 2 CartCheck only reports.

214
00:13:19,630 --> 00:13:24,644
筛选能缩小范围，但校验说了算：第 3 幕的工作流会拦下它
Selection narrows, but validation decides: the act 3 workflow blocks it.

215
00:13:24,883 --> 00:13:28,254
第 9 步是可选的基线，两种模式都跑
Step 9 is the optional baseline, in both modes.

216
00:13:28,574 --> 00:13:33,310
在 standard 场景里，保存的偏好重复了需求，所以可能变化不大
For standard, the saved preferences repeat the request, so little may change.

217
00:13:33,630 --> 00:13:35,656
暂停一下，跑第 8、9 步
Pause and run steps 8 and 9.

218
00:13:37,900 --> 00:13:41,641
所以筛选候选有帮助，但校验说了算
So selecting candidates helps, but validation decides,

219
00:13:41,641 --> 00:13:44,897
今天的需求优先于保存的偏好
and today's request outranks saved preferences.

220
00:13:45,217 --> 00:13:49,292
第二部分，harness 会把购物车的路线从模型手里拿走
In part 2, the harness takes the cart's route out of the model's hands.

221
00:13:51,233 --> 00:13:53,709
第二部分从 container 的提示符接着来
Part 2 picks up at the container prompt;

222
00:13:53,709 --> 00:13:56,865
如果你把它关了，就重新跑一遍准备步骤，再设置好你的密钥
if you closed it, rerun the setup and set your key.

223
00:13:57,185 --> 00:14:02,170
回想一下往右移的那个箭头：风险高、操作无法撤销
Remember the move-right arrow: when stakes are high, actions can't be undone,

224
00:14:02,170 --> 00:14:06,572
任务可预测或者需要审计的时候，就把控制权交给代码
the task is predictable, or you need an audit, give control to code.

225
00:14:06,816 --> 00:14:08,672
第 3 幕做的正是这件事
Act 3 does exactly that.

226
00:14:08,992 --> 00:14:12,277
下单路线是一张图，它的边归 Python 管
The order route is a graph, and Python owns its edges.

227
00:14:12,597 --> 00:14:18,876
确认、提议、校验，只有报告不通过才退回提议，最多两次
Confirm, propose, validate, and back to propose only if the report fails, at most twice;

228
00:14:18,876 --> 00:14:23,584
然后是搭配、需要时经理审核，最后重新校验并下单
then pairings, manager review when required, revalidate and place.

229
00:14:23,904 --> 00:14:28,235
只有一个节点归模型：propose cart 节点，不带任何工具
Only one node belongs to the model: propose cart, with no tools.

230
00:14:28,483 --> 00:14:31,170
README 把它归在 harness 下面
The README files this under the harness;

231
00:14:31,170 --> 00:14:35,671
在课上的自主性光谱上，它靠近结构化输出
on the lecture's autonomy spectrum, it sits near structured output:

232
00:14:35,671 --> 00:14:37,955
一张固定的图，只有一步交给模型
a fixed graph with one model step.

233
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:40,952
第 1 步：第 3 幕，standard 场景
Step 1: act 3, scenario standard.

234
00:14:41,272 --> 00:14:44,121
有密钥的话，模型提议数量
With a key, the model proposes quantities;

235
00:14:44,121 --> 00:14:48,461
其余的都由代码来做：流转、定价、校验、下单
code does the rest: transitions, pricing, validation, placement.

236
00:14:48,781 --> 00:14:50,381
成功就是一张回执
Success is a receipt.

237
00:14:50,533 --> 00:14:55,210
第 2、3 步是运输这一课，用的是一位顾客自己的购物车
Steps 2 and 3 are the shipping lesson, with a customer's own cart:

238
00:14:55,210 --> 00:14:58,469
Comté、Bûcheron 和 Époisses，寄往宾夕法尼亚
Comté, Bûcheron and Époisses, to Pennsylvania.

239
00:14:58,789 --> 00:15:03,312
改之前，模型只记录购物车；harness 检查它，然后停下
Before, the model only records the cart; the harness checks it and stops.

240
00:15:03,632 --> 00:15:07,557
改之后，修订循环打开了，在线模型可能会修正它
After, the revise loop opens, and the live model may fix it.

241
00:15:08,216 --> 00:15:11,645
额外再跑一个：--fixture 离线走同一条路线
As an extra, --fixture runs the same path offline,

242
00:15:11,645 --> 00:15:13,976
模型的位置上坐的是一个脚本
with a script in the model's seat.

243
00:15:14,296 --> 00:15:18,917
第 1 次尝试里有生乳的 Comté，轨道把它退了回去
Attempt 1 has raw-milk Comté, and the rail sends it back;

244
00:15:18,917 --> 00:15:22,403
第 2 次换成 Taleggio：有效，50.10 美元
attempt 2 swaps in Taleggio: valid, $50.10.

245
00:15:24,466 --> 00:15:25,466
有个坑
One trap:

246
00:15:25,466 --> 00:15:30,669
用 fixture 时，blocked 场景会把同一辆购物车一连提议三次
with fixtures, the blocked scenario proposes the same cart three times and ends

247
00:15:30,669 --> 00:15:32,496
最后是 UNRESOLVED，不是 BLOCKED
UNRESOLVED, not BLOCKED,

248
00:15:32,496 --> 00:15:35,794
所以在 Colab 里，这一课要把 fixture 关掉
so in Colab keep fixtures off for this lesson.

249
00:15:36,114 --> 00:15:38,184
暂停一下，把第 1 到第 3 步跑一遍
Pause and run steps 1 to 3.

250
00:15:41,533 --> 00:15:47,930
第 4 步是脚本模拟的，所以审批结果可以预期：纽约 60 位客人
Step 4 is scripted, so approval is predictable: 60 guests in New York,

251
00:15:47,930 --> 00:15:52,498
一辆有效的购物车，220.80 美元，超过了 200 美元的门槛
a valid cart at $220.80, above the $200 threshold.

252
00:15:52,733 --> 00:15:57,725
工作流暂停了，你就是经理：回答的是宿主程序，绝不是 agent
The workflow pauses, and you are the manager: the host answers, never the agent.

253
00:15:58,045 --> 00:15:59,300
输入 approve
Type approve.

254
00:15:59,350 --> 00:16:01,873
你批准的到底是什么？一个指纹
What did you approve? A fingerprint:

255
00:16:01,873 --> 00:16:09,270
SHA-256 哈希，覆盖需求、商品明细、小计、政策和商品属性
the SHA-256 hash, taken over the request, the items, the subtotal, the policy and the product attributes.

256
00:16:09,590 --> 00:16:13,472
库存是故意排除在外的：它会被重新检查，而不是被批准
Stock is left out on purpose: it's rechecked, not approved.

257
00:16:13,716 --> 00:16:16,895
结账时，购物车会再校验一次，再算一次哈希
At checkout the cart is validated and hashed again.

258
00:16:17,215 --> 00:16:20,362
批准要算数，决定必须是 approve
The approval counts only if the decision is approve,

259
00:16:20,362 --> 00:16:23,871
而且审批单要对得上这次结账和这个指纹
and the ticket matches this checkout and this fingerprint.

260
00:16:24,191 --> 00:16:26,644
改动一行，哈希就不一样了
Change one line, and the hashes differ.

261
00:16:28,550 --> 00:16:31,472
你思考的时间不算进预算
Your thinking time doesn't count against the budget.

262
00:16:32,150 --> 00:16:36,843
再额外试一次，改成输入 decline：工作流结束，没有订单
And as an extra, type decline instead: the workflow ends, with no order.

263
00:16:37,083 --> 00:16:38,683
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

264
00:16:38,747 --> 00:16:40,347
经理批准了
The manager approves.

265
00:16:40,496 --> 00:16:44,358
在结账执行之前，另一个订单拿走了大部分 Mimolette
Before checkout runs, another order takes most of the Mimolette.

266
00:16:44,678 --> 00:16:48,667
结账会怎么做，为什么批准保护不了这个订单？
What does checkout do, and why doesn't the approval protect this order?

267
00:16:57,516 --> 00:17:01,249
结账时重新校验，发现库存违规，就把它拦下了
Checkout revalidates, finds a stock violation, and blocks.

268
00:17:01,569 --> 00:17:07,777
库存不在指纹里：批准授权的是一个决定；它不预留任何东西
Stock isn't in the fingerprint: an approval authorizes a decision; it doesn't reserve anything.

269
00:17:08,097 --> 00:17:09,868
第 6 幕会把这个真的跑一遍
Act 6 shows this for real.

270
00:17:10,116 --> 00:17:14,084
第 5 步：Munster 的库存是 0 克，所以第 1 次尝试失败了
Step 5: Munster has 0 grams, so attempt 1 fails.

271
00:17:14,404 --> 00:17:17,428
一次有上限的修订换成了 Époisses
One bounded revision swaps in Époisses,

272
00:17:17,428 --> 00:17:21,615
订单以 50.10 美元下单，模型调用为零
and the order places at $50.10, with zero model calls.

273
00:17:21,850 --> 00:17:23,791
第 6 步是 notebook 单元格
Step 6 is the notebook cell.

274
00:17:24,111 --> 00:17:26,857
它的 trace 层和 budget 层可以拆掉
Its trace and budget layers can come off;

275
00:17:26,857 --> 00:17:32,282
校验、审批和重新校验是图和结账的规则，所以保留
validation, approval and revalidation are graph and checkout rules, so they stay.

276
00:17:32,516 --> 00:17:37,508
所以批准绑定的正是这辆购物车，而结账在暂停之后还会重新校验
So an approval binds this exact cart, and checkout revalidates after the pause.

277
00:17:37,828 --> 00:17:41,583
暂停一下，跑第 4、5 步；单元格是给 Colab 用的
Pause and run steps 4 and 5; the cell is for Colab.

278
00:17:44,933 --> 00:17:47,577
第 4 幕是一个规划器，处理更长的任务
Act 4 is a planner for a longer task:

279
00:17:47,577 --> 00:17:49,648
纽约一场 40 位客人的活动
a 40-guest event in New York.

280
00:17:49,968 --> 00:17:53,767
课上把记忆分成长期和短期
The lecture splits memory into long-term and short-term;

281
00:17:53,767 --> 00:17:56,277
这里对应的是保存的记忆和历史
here that's saved memory and history,

282
00:17:56,277 --> 00:18:00,144
再加上任务、审批和审计：五种状态
plus tasks, approvals and the audit: five kinds of state.

283
00:18:00,383 --> 00:18:03,498
README 问的是，这些里面哪一个能授权行动
The README asks which of these can authorize an action.

284
00:18:03,818 --> 00:18:05,866
只有一个：审批抽屉
Only one: the approval drawer.

285
00:18:06,100 --> 00:18:07,721
第 1 步：第 4 幕
Step 1: act 4.

286
00:18:08,041 --> 00:18:12,500
在任何模型调用之前，harness 就打印出第一位顾客保存的记忆
Before any model call, the harness prints the first customer's saved memory.

287
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:14,425
然后是规划器的工具
Then the planner's tools:

288
00:18:14,425 --> 00:18:19,174
评估活动、读取供应商的文档、起草和保存给供应商的邮件
assess the event, read the vendor document, draft and save a vendor email,

289
00:18:19,174 --> 00:18:20,727
以及待办工具
and the to-do tools.

290
00:18:20,777 --> 00:18:22,398
没有哪个工具能写记忆
No tool writes memory.

291
00:18:23,266 --> 00:18:25,869
有密钥的话，要找的是活动说明
With a key, look for the brief:

292
00:18:25,869 --> 00:18:31,159
Comté 和 Mimolette 各 1000 克，Époisses 1200 克
1,000 grams each of Comté and Mimolette, and 1,200 of Époisses.

293
00:18:31,479 --> 00:18:36,066
店里的 Époisses 只有 900 克：差 300 克
The shop has only 900 grams of Époisses: 300 short.

294
00:18:36,386 --> 00:18:41,186
完成的任务不等于批准，店里的库存也不等于供应商有货
A finished task is not an approval, and shop stock is not vendor availability.

295
00:18:41,433 --> 00:18:44,784
保存邮件这个工具，approval mode 设为 always require
Saving the email has approval_mode="always_require",

296
00:18:44,784 --> 00:18:47,684
所以框架会在保存执行之前暂停
so the framework pauses before the save runs.

297
00:18:48,004 --> 00:18:51,502
第 3 幕暂停的是整个工作流；这里只暂停一个工具
Act 3 paused a whole workflow; this pauses one tool.

298
00:18:51,750 --> 00:18:55,441
你批准之后的输出，来自一次脚本模拟的额外运行
The output after you approve comes from a scripted extra run.

299
00:18:55,761 --> 00:18:57,992
审核里显示供应商地址
The review shows the vendor address

300
00:18:57,992 --> 00:19:01,115
和一段由代码写的正文，坚果过敏也写在里面
and a body written by code, nut allergy included.

301
00:19:01,435 --> 00:19:05,403
然后：status 为 saved，email transmitted 为 no，文件路径
Then: status: saved, email transmitted: no, and the file path.

302
00:19:05,650 --> 00:19:09,453
接着是测试里出现过的审批身份警告
Then comes the approval-identity warning you saw in the tests:

303
00:19:09,453 --> 00:19:12,029
README 预告过它，它是无害的
the README predicts it, and it's harmless.

304
00:19:12,349 --> 00:19:14,098
以权威结果那一块为准
Trust the authoritative block.

305
00:19:14,418 --> 00:19:16,018
暂停一下，跑第 1 步
Pause and run step 1.

306
00:19:19,367 --> 00:19:23,307
第 2 步离线运行：一个脚本模拟的规划器，带压缩
Step 2 runs offline: a scripted planner with compaction,

307
00:19:23,307 --> 00:19:26,684
一份恶意的供应商文档，还有一次测试用的拒绝
a malicious vendor document, and a test decline.

308
00:19:27,004 --> 00:19:31,314
它先放进十二条合成笔记，每条大约 15000 个字符
It first seeds twelve synthetic notes of about 15,000 characters.

309
00:19:31,550 --> 00:19:37,054
窗口是 16000 个 token，其中 2400 个留给回复
The window is 16,000 tokens, with 2,400 kept for the reply.

310
00:19:37,374 --> 00:19:42,278
超过剩下部分的 80% 时，截断会丢掉最旧的消息
Above 80 percent of the rest, truncation drops the oldest messages

311
00:19:42,278 --> 00:19:45,993
直到历史回到一半以下：26 条变成 5 条
until the history is back under half: 26 become 5.

312
00:19:46,234 --> 00:19:47,834
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

313
00:19:47,898 --> 00:19:50,550
压缩丢掉了 26 条消息里的 21 条
Compaction dropped 21 of 26 messages,

314
00:19:50,550 --> 00:19:54,063
而且历史里没有一条提到坚果过敏
and none of the history mentions the nut allergy.

315
00:19:54,383 --> 00:19:56,580
那每次调用怎么还会知道这件事？
How does every call still know about it?

316
00:20:05,417 --> 00:20:06,690
一个胶囊
A capsule.

317
00:20:06,740 --> 00:20:10,683
每次调用之前，harness 先取出旧胶囊、做压缩
Before every call, the harness takes the old one out, compacts,

318
00:20:10,683 --> 00:20:13,438
再根据应用状态钉上一个新的
and pins a fresh one from application state.

319
00:20:13,758 --> 00:20:17,498
里面有已确认的需求，包括坚果过敏
It holds the confirmed request with its nut allergy,

320
00:20:17,498 --> 00:20:20,878
还有菜单、任务、待处理的审核和未完成的工作
the menu, tasks, pending reviews and open work,

321
00:20:20,878 --> 00:20:23,252
都标明是数据，不是指令
marked as data, not instructions.

322
00:20:24,650 --> 00:20:26,481
这就是课上的压缩触发条件
That's the lecture's compaction trigger,

323
00:20:26,481 --> 00:20:28,704
以及什么东西持久保存在哪里，都写成了代码
and what persists where, in code.

324
00:20:28,950 --> 00:20:33,515
供应商文档要求忽略过敏，所以它被隔离了
The vendor document says to ignore the allergy, so it lands in quarantine.

325
00:20:33,835 --> 00:20:36,013
检测器故意做得很小
The detector is deliberately small;

326
00:20:36,013 --> 00:20:39,809
真正的防线是收件人白名单，还有你的审核
the real guards are the recipient allowlist, and your review.

327
00:20:40,650 --> 00:20:42,698
起草的邮件里仍然写着坚果过敏
The drafted email still says nuts.

328
00:20:43,018 --> 00:20:49,141
结果：DECLINED，没有保存 HTML，7 次模型调用，7 次压缩
The result: DECLINED, no HTML saved, 7 model calls and 7 compactions.

329
00:20:49,384 --> 00:20:53,123
第 3、4 步是可选的记忆练习
Steps 3 and 4 are the optional memory exercise;

330
00:20:53,123 --> 00:20:57,896
照 README 第 484 行输入，因为这里的 ID 被遮住了
type them from README line 484, since the ID is masked here.

331
00:20:58,216 --> 00:21:01,879
第一条命令给第二位顾客存一条偏好
The first command stores a preference for the second customer,

332
00:21:01,879 --> 00:21:05,661
记忆在任何模型调用之前就打印出来，即使没有密钥也一样
and the memory prints before any model call, even without a key.

333
00:21:05,981 --> 00:21:09,714
下一次来访时它又会显示出来；额外检查会读取这个文件
The next visit shows it again; an extra check reads the file.

334
00:21:11,567 --> 00:21:14,852
课上让模型来建议什么值得记住
The lecture lets the model suggest what's worth remembering.

335
00:21:15,172 --> 00:21:19,652
这个 harness 连这一点也移到了右边：只有宿主程序能写记忆
This harness moves even that to the right: only the host writes memory.

336
00:21:20,500 --> 00:21:23,492
第 5 步是 notebook 单元格，给 Colab 用
Step 5 is the notebook cell, for Colab:

337
00:21:23,492 --> 00:21:25,641
build act 4 加了五层
build_act4 adds five layers.

338
00:21:25,961 --> 00:21:28,927
去掉压缩之后，胶囊还是会重新钉上
Without compaction, the capsule is still re-pinned.

339
00:21:29,247 --> 00:21:31,274
暂停一下，把第 2 到第 4 步跑一遍
Pause and run steps 2 to 4.

340
00:21:34,617 --> 00:21:36,117
第 5 幕加入了 skill
Act 5 adds skills:

341
00:21:36,117 --> 00:21:39,950
装着操作流程的目录，agent 只在相关时才加载
folders of procedure the agent loads only when relevant.

342
00:21:40,270 --> 00:21:44,430
它们解决两个问题：专业知识的缺口，和上下文预算
They solve two problems: the expertise gap and the context budget.

343
00:21:44,667 --> 00:21:48,386
加载 skill 分三步，token 成本一步比一步高
Skills load in three steps of rising token cost:

344
00:21:48,386 --> 00:21:52,879
每个 skill 的名字和描述，各大约 100 个 token
every skill's name and description, about 100 tokens each;

345
00:21:52,879 --> 00:21:55,126
然后是它的主文件 SKILL.md
then its main file, SKILL.md;

346
00:21:55,126 --> 00:21:58,768
再然后是一份参考资料或资源文件，只在需要时读取
then a reference or an asset, only when needed.

347
00:21:59,017 --> 00:22:01,326
课上的 skill 还带一个 scripts 目录
The lecture's skill also has a scripts folder for the agent to run.

348
00:22:01,326 --> 00:22:03,028
里面的脚本由 agent 来运行
The lecture's skill also has a scripts folder for the agent to run.

349
00:22:03,348 --> 00:22:08,830
这个 harness 故意去掉了那个工具：skill 只提建议，从不执行
This harness removes that tool on purpose: a skill advises, and never executes.

350
00:22:09,067 --> 00:22:10,688
第 1 步：第 5 幕
Step 1: act 5.

351
00:22:11,008 --> 00:22:15,680
一开始只加载元数据：tasting-planning 和 vendor-outreach
Only the metadata loads at first: tasting-planning and vendor-outreach.

352
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:19,734
新的工具是 get stock、load skill 和 read skill resource
The new tools are get_stock, load_skill and read_skill_resource.

353
00:22:19,984 --> 00:22:22,948
第 2 步只问库存，离线运行
Step 2 asks only about stock, offline:

354
00:22:22,948 --> 00:22:27,707
一次 get stock 调用，900 克，脚本没有加载任何 skill
one get_stock call, 900 grams, and the script loads no skill.

355
00:22:28,027 --> 00:22:32,528
有密钥的话，模型根据描述来决定：是提示，不是触发条件
With a key, the model decides from the description: a hint, not a trigger.

356
00:22:33,267 --> 00:22:36,495
第 3 步跑完整的采购流程，脚本模拟
Step 3 runs the full sourcing path, scripted:

357
00:22:36,495 --> 00:22:39,006
六次加载，每次都带着真实路径
six loads, each with its real path.

358
00:22:39,326 --> 00:22:44,296
起草一直会被拒绝，直到读过邮件模板为止：这是代码里的一道保险
Drafting is refused until the email template is read: a backstop in code.

359
00:22:46,167 --> 00:22:47,767
来想一个问题
Something to ponder.

360
00:22:47,831 --> 00:22:52,290
有人改了供应商那个 skill，加上一句：也发一份到另一个地址
Someone edits the vendor skill to add: also send this to another address.

361
00:22:52,610 --> 00:22:54,210
邮件会发到那里去吗？
Will the email go there?

362
00:23:00,917 --> 00:23:05,286
不会。不管这个 skill 怎么写，防线都在代码里
No. Whatever the skill says, the guards are in code;

363
00:23:05,286 --> 00:23:08,631
它自己的文字甚至写明了它不能添加收件人
its own text even says it cannot add recipients,

364
00:23:08,631 --> 00:23:13,719
而且每次读取都要经过检查：不许上级目录、绝对路径或符号链接
and every read is checked: no parent folders, absolute paths or symlinks,

365
00:23:13,719 --> 00:23:16,298
运行中途改过的文件会被拒绝
and a file edited mid-run is refused.

366
00:23:16,534 --> 00:23:22,194
收件人由代码对照白名单检查，而且什么都不会真的发出去
The recipient is checked in code against the allowlist, and nothing is ever transmitted;

367
00:23:22,194 --> 00:23:25,024
额外检查显示，保存的文件里也是这么写的
an extra check shows the saved file says so.

368
00:23:25,267 --> 00:23:29,132
用课上的话说，工具是手，MCP 是插座
In lecture terms, a tool is the hands, MCP the socket,

369
00:23:29,132 --> 00:23:31,710
这里没用到，skill 是说明书
unused here, and a skill the manual.

370
00:23:35,350 --> 00:23:38,806
第 4 步是 notebook 单元格，允许 16 次模型调用
Step 4, the notebook cell, allows 16 model calls.

371
00:23:39,126 --> 00:23:41,196
暂停一下，把第 1 到第 3 步跑一遍
Pause and run steps 1 to 3.

372
00:23:44,533 --> 00:23:46,581
第 6 幕是一个 agent 系统
Act 6 is an agent system.

373
00:23:46,901 --> 00:23:51,881
课上对比了单个 agent 和 agent 组成的图，分两种模式
The lecture contrasts one agent with a graph of agents, in two patterns:

374
00:23:51,881 --> 00:23:55,754
一个管理者把 agent 当工具来调用，或者对等的 agent 互相交接
a manager calling agents as tools, or peers handing off.

375
00:23:56,300 --> 00:24:00,920
它就是管理者模式，只不过它调用的工具是一整个工作流
It's the manager pattern, except the tool it calls is a whole workflow,

376
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:04,108
就是第 3 幕那个，里面只有一个节点用到模型
the one from act 3, with a model inside one node.

377
00:24:04,428 --> 00:24:05,683
没有交接
No handoffs.

378
00:24:05,733 --> 00:24:08,122
第 1 步是 notebook 单元格，用来构建它
Step 1, the notebook cell, builds it.

379
00:24:08,442 --> 00:24:12,363
预算是：16 次外层模型调用，20 次工具调用
The budget: 16 outer model calls, 20 tool calls,

380
00:24:12,363 --> 00:24:17,509
每个工作流 8 次提议者调用，再加一个共享的 180 秒时钟
8 proposer calls per workflow, and one shared 180-second clock.

381
00:24:17,750 --> 00:24:21,782
宿主程序确认这些需求；模型只负责挑一个 ID
The host confirms the requests; the model only picks an ID.

382
00:24:22,102 --> 00:24:26,326
工具都很窄：start order、get order status、assess event
Its tools are narrow: start_order, get_order_status, assess_event.

383
00:24:26,566 --> 00:24:28,657
第 2 步：第 6 幕，standard 场景
Step 2: act 6, standard.

384
00:24:28,977 --> 00:24:32,893
有密钥的话，要分清外层模型调用和工作流里的调用
With a key, tell outer model calls apart from workflow calls;

385
00:24:32,893 --> 00:24:35,782
外层 agent 不能批准自己的订单
the outer agent cannot approve its own order.

386
00:24:36,016 --> 00:24:39,579
第 3 步离线运行：两个订单共用一家店
Step 3 runs offline: two orders sharing one shop.

387
00:24:39,899 --> 00:24:42,041
两辆购物车都以 220.80 美元通过
Both carts pass at $220.80,

388
00:24:42,041 --> 00:24:46,960
都暂停等经理，测试用的决定把两个都批准了
both pause for a manager, and the test decision approves both.

389
00:24:47,200 --> 00:24:50,869
Mimolette 和 Taleggio 一开始各有 3000 克
Mimolette and Taleggio start at 3,000 grams each.

390
00:24:51,189 --> 00:24:54,603
订单 1 下单了，剩下 1400 克
Request 1 is placed, leaving 1,400.

391
00:24:54,923 --> 00:24:59,808
订单 2 走到重新校验时需要 1600 克：被拦下了
Request 2 reaches revalidation needing 1,600: blocked.

392
00:25:00,128 --> 00:25:04,586
这就是第 3 幕那个思考题，真的发生了：批准不等于下单
That's the ponder from act 3, for real: approval is not placement.

393
00:25:04,833 --> 00:25:10,076
最终回答就是课上的回复步骤：应用检查模型的计划
The final answer is the lecture's response step: the app checks the model's plan

394
00:25:10,076 --> 00:25:14,860
再根据回执填上数量、价格和状态 placed
and fills in quantities, prices and the status, placed, from the receipt.

395
00:25:15,180 --> 00:25:18,271
被拦下的订单显示 Invalid or unauthorized
The blocked order says Invalid or unauthorized;

396
00:25:18,271 --> 00:25:20,769
下面库存那几行给出了原因
the stock lines below give the reason.

397
00:25:21,016 --> 00:25:24,503
在自主性光谱上，它是混合型，只不过里外反过来
On the autonomy spectrum it's a hybrid, inside out:

398
00:25:24,503 --> 00:25:27,715
外面是 agent，固定的图是它的工具
the agent outside, the fixed graph as its tool.

399
00:25:28,035 --> 00:25:30,062
暂停一下，跑第 2、3 步
Pause and run steps 2 and 3.

400
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:37,620
服务商的模型和产品之间的一切都是我们的
Everything between the provider's model and the product is ours:

401
00:25:37,620 --> 00:25:39,928
上下文、harness、工具和 skill
context, harness, tools and skills.

402
00:25:40,248 --> 00:25:42,040
所以这些全都要测试
So all of it must be tested.

403
00:25:42,283 --> 00:25:46,336
课上衡量三样东西：结果、轨迹和成本
The lecture measures three things: outcome, trajectory and cost.

404
00:25:46,656 --> 00:25:49,122
在这里，就是 outcome 检查和 process 检查
Here they're the outcome and process checks,

405
00:25:49,122 --> 00:25:50,722
再加上调用次数和 token
plus calls and tokens.

406
00:25:50,883 --> 00:25:53,272
评测第 1 步列出所有运行
Evaluation step 1 lists the runs.

407
00:25:53,592 --> 00:25:56,744
到目前为止的每次运行都在同一个 SQLite 数据库里
Every run so far is in one SQLite database,

408
00:25:56,744 --> 00:26:00,483
包括失败的在线运行，status 为 error
including the failed live ones, with status: error.

409
00:26:00,733 --> 00:26:02,906
这个 --inspect-run 要一个 run ID
--inspect-run takes a run ID:

410
00:26:02,906 --> 00:26:06,728
照字面输入就会失败，因为它是个模板
typed literally, it fails, because it's a template.

411
00:26:07,048 --> 00:26:10,483
贴一个真实的；我们用 manager-approval 那次运行
Paste a real one; we use the manager-approval run.

412
00:26:11,333 --> 00:26:15,919
事件依次是：approval.requested，带着指纹
The events read in order: approval.requested with the fingerprint,

413
00:26:15,919 --> 00:26:17,864
approval.decided，由人做出
approval.decided by a human,

414
00:26:17,864 --> 00:26:21,338
policy.decision allow、order.placed、run.finished
policy.decision allow, order.placed, run.finished.

415
00:26:21,658 --> 00:26:25,051
下单的证据是一个事件，不是文字
The evidence for order placed is an event, not the prose.

416
00:26:27,167 --> 00:26:32,052
再额外查看第一次失败的运行：model.failed，带着 401
As an extra, inspect the first failed run: model.failed, with the 401.

417
00:26:32,372 --> 00:26:34,143
失败也是证据
A failure is evidence too.

418
00:26:34,383 --> 00:26:38,885
评测第 2 步先离线跑第 2 幕的评测
Evaluation step 2 starts offline: the act 2 evaluation,

419
00:26:38,885 --> 00:26:42,895
脚本模拟，重复两次，label 是 context-fixture-1
scripted, two repeats, labeled context-fixture-1.

420
00:26:43,215 --> 00:26:44,715
全部 4 次运行都通过了
All 4 runs pass,

421
00:26:44,715 --> 00:26:48,015
但脚本模拟的运行测的是这套机制，不是模型
but scripted runs test the machinery, not the model.

422
00:26:48,250 --> 00:26:52,282
然后把报告读回来，再导出 HTML 记分卡
Then read the report back, and export the HTML scorecard,

423
00:26:52,282 --> 00:26:54,970
放到默认路径，或者你自己选的路径
to its default path or one you choose.

424
00:26:56,550 --> 00:26:59,238
从你笔记本上的 outputs 目录里打开它
Open it from the outputs folder on your laptop.

425
00:27:00,567 --> 00:27:04,830
最后一条命令是个模板，给从 Colab 复制过来的数据库用
The last command is a template for a database copied from Colab:

426
00:27:04,830 --> 00:27:06,562
照字面输入就会失败
typed literally, it fails.

427
00:27:06,882 --> 00:27:10,274
每个 label 都不可更改：重复用一个，这一批就会停下来
Labels are immutable: reuse one, and the batch stops.

428
00:27:10,594 --> 00:27:13,580
暂停一下，跑评测第 1、2 步
Pause and run evaluation steps 1 and 2.

429
00:27:16,917 --> 00:27:20,416
评测第 3 步比较两套配置
Evaluation step 3 compares two configurations.

430
00:27:20,736 --> 00:27:24,745
课上提醒，改一次 prompt 可能修好一个用例，又弄坏三个
The lecture warns that a prompt edit can fix one case and break three,

431
00:27:24,745 --> 00:27:26,300
所以要逐个用例比较
so compare per case.

432
00:27:26,350 --> 00:27:31,928
课上的改进循环：发现失败，记录成测试用例，只改一层
The lecture's improvement loop: see a failure, capture a test case, change one layer,

433
00:27:31,928 --> 00:27:36,654
把测试集跑 k 次，和基线比较，然后合并或者继续迭代
run the suite k times, compare with the baseline, then merge or iterate.

434
00:27:38,417 --> 00:27:42,918
批次 A 用 enriched 模式跑两个用例，各两次：4 次在线运行
Batch A runs enriched mode on two cases, twice: 4 live runs.

435
00:27:43,238 --> 00:27:47,014
没有密钥：4 次里 0 次通过，3 个错误，1 个缺失
Without a key: 0 of 4, with 3 errors and 1 missing.

436
00:27:47,334 --> 00:27:51,004
如果有一批失败了，就修好密钥，用新的 label 把两批都重跑一遍
If one fails, fix the key and rerun both with new labels.

437
00:27:51,250 --> 00:27:54,636
复制 prompt 文件，在你的笔记本上改这份副本
Copy the prompt file and edit the copy on your laptop:

438
00:27:54,636 --> 00:27:58,525
只做一处有意的改动，保留已确认约束的那些规则
one deliberate change, keeping the confirmed constraint rules.

439
00:27:58,767 --> 00:28:02,976
我们额外追加了一行，要求写出价格和行动状态
Our extra appends a line asking for a price and an action status;

440
00:28:02,976 --> 00:28:04,676
用 diff 一看，正好只多了这一行
diff shows just that line.

441
00:28:05,450 --> 00:28:08,398
批次 B 用同样的用例和设置
Batch B runs the same cases and settings,

442
00:28:08,398 --> 00:28:11,274
再加上 --prompt-file 指向那份副本
with --prompt-file pointing at the copy.

443
00:28:11,517 --> 00:28:13,117
然后离线比较
Then compare, offline.

444
00:28:13,394 --> 00:28:15,720
改动的配置：prompt
Changed configuration: prompt.

445
00:28:16,040 --> 00:28:18,130
混杂改动：没有
Confounding changes: none.

446
00:28:18,450 --> 00:28:21,558
改了代码、数据或模型，它都会指出来
Change code, data or the model, and it says so:

447
00:28:21,558 --> 00:28:25,064
这就是课上“只改一层”的规则，由代码来检查
the lecture's change-one-layer rule, checked in code.

448
00:28:25,500 --> 00:28:28,989
比较只在通过或失败翻转时才标出一次运行
Compare flags a run only when pass or fail flips;

449
00:28:28,989 --> 00:28:31,410
这里每次运行前后两次都报错
here every run errored both times.

450
00:28:32,450 --> 00:28:35,458
再额外比较两个脚本模拟的批次
As an extra, comparing two scripted batches

451
00:28:35,458 --> 00:28:40,216
四次运行全部不变，因为 fixture 不看 prompt
reports all four runs unchanged, because fixtures ignore the prompt.

452
00:28:40,450 --> 00:28:43,629
评测第 4 步问的是，这些检查能证明什么
Evaluation step 4 asks what the checks establish.

453
00:28:43,949 --> 00:28:47,726
它们检查的是属性，比如购物车是否有效、审批的顺序
They check properties, like cart validity and approval order;

454
00:28:47,726 --> 00:28:51,565
文字要靠你来审，用 README 里的五个问题
the prose needs your review, with the README's five questions.

455
00:28:51,800 --> 00:28:55,747
课上列了三种评委：代码、模型和人
The lecture lists three judges: code, a model and a human.

456
00:28:56,067 --> 00:28:58,819
这个教程用了其中两个：代码，和你
This tutorial uses two: code, and you.

457
00:28:59,139 --> 00:29:03,064
尽量偏向代码，任务允许多少就偏多少，和 harness 里一样
Lean toward code as far as the task allows, as in the harness.

458
00:29:03,300 --> 00:29:06,393
报告一个差异、它的证据，以及一个局限
Report one difference, its evidence, and one limit.

459
00:29:06,713 --> 00:29:11,193
还有，留好你的用例：评测集是最有价值的产物
And keep your cases: the eval set is the most valuable artifact.

460
00:29:11,513 --> 00:29:13,924
暂停一下，跑评测第 3 步
Pause and run evaluation step 3.

461
00:29:17,267 --> 00:29:20,537
第 7 节的 repo 地图最后一条是
The repository map of section 7 ends

462
00:29:20,537 --> 00:29:25,352
python cli.py --help，所有选项都在一个地方
with python cli.py --help: every option in one place.

463
00:29:25,600 --> 00:29:28,789
所有 trace，以及在线运行写下的记忆，都保存在 SQLite 里
Traces and live memory stay in SQLite.

464
00:29:28,839 --> 00:29:33,634
库存、订单、审批单和待处理的工作流只存在于一个进程里
Inventory, orders, tickets and pending workflows last for one process;

465
00:29:33,634 --> 00:29:36,032
任务和历史，只存在于一个 session 里
tasks and history, for one session.

466
00:29:36,267 --> 00:29:38,720
现在来拆掉；这几步都是额外的
Now tear down; these steps are extras.

467
00:29:39,040 --> 00:29:41,918
在每个 container 的 shell 里输入 exit
Type exit in each container shell;

468
00:29:41,918 --> 00:29:47,083
它是用 --rm 启动的，所以 docker ps -a 里什么都不剩
it was started with --rm, so nothing is left in docker ps -a.

469
00:29:47,317 --> 00:29:49,728
你笔记本上的 outputs 目录会留着
The outputs folder stays on your laptop.

470
00:29:50,048 --> 00:29:54,027
里面的 trace 数据库存着你的 prompt 和输出，密钥已经脱敏
Its trace database holds your prompts and outputs, keys redacted;

471
00:29:54,027 --> 00:29:55,680
用完了就把它删掉
delete it when you're done.

472
00:29:55,917 --> 00:30:00,541
用 docker image rm，能腾出那 1.77 GB 里的大部分
docker image rm frees most of those 1.77 gigabytes;

473
00:30:00,541 --> 00:30:02,445
留下的是 base image
the base image stays.

474
00:30:02,765 --> 00:30:05,283
然后关掉存过你密钥的那个终端
Then close the terminal that held your key,

475
00:30:05,283 --> 00:30:09,677
别让密钥进文件、commit 和 shell 历史记录，再留意你的用量
keep it out of files, commits and your shell history, and watch your usage.

476
00:30:09,997 --> 00:30:12,088
在 Colab 里，删除运行时
In Colab, delete the runtime.

477
00:30:12,408 --> 00:30:14,008
暂停一下，把它拆掉
Pause, and tear down.

478
00:30:16,017 --> 00:30:20,303
这就是行动边界，现在填好了：预算和图
Here is the action boundary, filled in: budgets and the graph;

479
00:30:20,303 --> 00:30:23,068
schema、审计和保存时的审批
schemas, the audit and approval on save;

480
00:30:23,068 --> 00:30:26,386
上下文包、胶囊和由宿主程序写的记忆
the packet, the capsule and host-written memory;

481
00:30:26,386 --> 00:30:28,253
CartCheck 和重新校验
CartCheck and revalidation;

482
00:30:28,253 --> 00:30:30,673
窄工具和分开的计数器
narrow tools and separate counters.

483
00:30:30,917 --> 00:30:32,901
模型提议，在左边
The model proposes, on the left.

484
00:30:33,221 --> 00:30:36,869
在右边，harness 决定；而在关键的地方，你也一样
On the right, the harness decides, and where it matters, so do you.

485
00:30:37,117 --> 00:30:39,997
README 最后有五个反思问题
The README ends with five reflection questions.

486
00:30:40,317 --> 00:30:42,621
挑一次你跑过的运行，回答这些问题
Pick one run you did, and answer them.

487
00:30:42,867 --> 00:30:44,246
自测一下
Test yourself.

488
00:30:44,296 --> 00:30:46,435
去掉 trace 之后，harness 还剩下什么？
What survives harness.without("trace")?

489
00:30:46,686 --> 00:30:49,352
为什么检索到的上下文要作为数据进来？
Why does retrieved context arrive as data?

490
00:30:49,672 --> 00:30:51,400
批准绑定的是什么？
What is an approval bound to?

491
00:30:51,720 --> 00:30:53,683
哪一种状态能授权一个行动？
Which state can authorize an action?

492
00:30:54,003 --> 00:30:56,563
还有，一批通过的 fixture 运行能证明什么？
And what does a passing fixture batch establish?

493
00:30:56,883 --> 00:31:00,339
暂停一下，试着答一答；答案在练习里
Pause and try them; answers are in the exercises.

494
00:31:03,584 --> 00:31:08,207
接下来，第 8 讲会在 Google 的 Agent Platform 上微调模型
Next, lecture 8 fine-tunes models on Google's Agent Platform,

495
00:31:08,207 --> 00:31:09,807
它以前叫 Vertex AI
formerly Vertex AI.

496
00:31:10,027 --> 00:31:12,918
第 9 讲用 pytest 测试代码
Lecture 9 tests code with pytest;

497
00:31:12,918 --> 00:31:17,386
这里的 281 个测试用的是 unittest，是很好的范例
these 281 tests use unittest, and are a good model.
